Assign >NIL: AmiTCP: SYS:Programs/AmiTCP
; Start the stack in the background so the loopback interface (lo0) is up
; Run detaches it -- if the stack ever stalled, the boot is NOT held up
; No hardware NIC is touched here (that is done manually, once the link
; is ready). GetNetStatus just opens the library, which self-starts.
If EXISTS C:GetNetStatus
   Run >NIL: <NIL: C:GetNetStatus >NIL:
EndIf